[Triggers]
Block	1	CaveHornet
Block	1	Rat
Block	1	Roach
Block	1	Goblin
Block	1	LavaSpawn
Block	1	LizardMan
Block	1	Orc
Region	Ring	24	22	58	48
Region	LampRoom	36	30	44	38
Region	NorthWest	3	12	22	28
Region	SouthCave	26	56	46	66
Region	EastGate	62	28	74	46
Region	SouthEast	58	52	74	66
Region	RivalGate	28	4	52	20
Region	SealedLantern	65	4	75	14
Region	WestNook	3	30	14	42
[Trigger]
Name	dusk
Mode	once
Cond	time	3
Action	message	1	Lanternhill is a hill that never goes dark, master. Its caves are lit from the ring road to the roots, and Lamplighter Ines Vale has set a rival keeper in the northern hall to keep them burning.
Action	objective	1	Destroy the heart of the rival keeper in the north.
Action	objective	1	Dig through the earth plugs to open the ring road.
Action	objective	1	Hold your own heart against the hill patrols.
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	ringEntered
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	Ring
Action	message	1	You are on the ring road. The lamp chamber lies sealed in the middle of the hill, and the north road is stopped with earth.
Action	reveal	1	LampRoom
Action	reveal	1	RivalGate
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	northwest
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	NorthWest
Action	message	1	These halls belong to nobody. A small crypt and a reading room stand empty. Claim them before the patrols do.
Action	gold	1	300
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	southCave
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	SouthCave
Action	message	1	A gaming hall of the hill folk, left open. Their creatures have wandered in and will serve whoever feeds them.
Action	spawn	1	36	58	1	Goblin:2	Spider:2	Rat:2
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	lampSeen
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	LampRoom
Action	message	1	The lamp chamber holds the great lantern, and a strong brew of mana comes off it. Your creatures feel bolder.
Action	gold	1	500
Action	terrain	40	34	40	34	manawell	1
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	mined1
Mode	once
Cond	mined	1	>=	700
Action	message	1	The seams hold. You can afford stronger doors and heavier traps now.
Action	generate	1	Spider:1
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	rivalGate
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	RivalGate
Action	message	1	The rival keeper has seen you and calls out his pack.
Action	spawn	2	40	16	1	Troll:3	Orc:3	Spider:3	Goblin:3
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	eastGate
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	EastGate
Action	message	1	The east gate is where the hill guard stands. Every wave of the kingdom comes through this road.
Action	spawn	3	69	32	1	Knight:3	Monk:2	Elf:2	Adventurer:2
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	hollowFound
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	SealedLantern
Action	message	1	The sisters of the lamp bricked this hollow up long ago. A pale stone glows in the wall, and a lost spider has lifted it. Bring it to your dungeon heart.
Action	spawn	1	70	9	1	Spider:1@LampBearer
Action	stoneattach	LampBearer
Action	setflag	lanternStone	1
Action	timer	lanternSpawn	0
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	lanternStoneHome
Mode	once
Cond	reached	LampBearer	heart	1
Action	message	1	The pale stone sinks into the heart and a hidden hall has opened.
Action	discover	campaign/TwistingHalls.level
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	lanternStoneLost
Mode	repeat	60
Cond	flag	lanternStone	1
Cond	timer	lanternSpawn	>=	5
Cond	alive	LampBearer	0
Action	message	1	The stone-bearer has fallen. Another creature has lifted the stone in the hollow.
Action	spawn	1	70	9	1	Spider:1@LampBearer
Action	stoneattach	LampBearer
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	patrol1
Mode	once
Cond	time	300
Action	message	1	Lamp guards are marching from the east gate.
Action	spawn	3	69	34	1	Adventurer:2	Dwarf1:2	Elf:2
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	patrol2
Mode	once
Cond	time	700
Action	message	1	A patrol with torches is crossing the creek.
Action	spawn	3	69	34	1	Knight:2	Monk:2	Adventurer:2	Elf:2
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	patrol3
Mode	once
Cond	time	1200
Action	message	1	Hill guards are coming up from the south-east cave.
Action	spawn	3	66	56	1	Knight:3	Elf:2	Adventurer:3	Monk:2
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	patrol4
Mode	once
Cond	time	1800
Action	message	1	Ines Vale has lit her beacon and the garrison is answering.
Action	spawn	3	69	34	1	Knight:3	Knight:2	Elf:3	Monk:3	Dwarf2:2
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	patrol5
Mode	once
Cond	time	2500
Action	message	1	A heavy column is on the east road.
Action	spawn	3	69	34	1	Knight:3	Knight:3	Elf:3	Monk:3	Dwarf2:3
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	patrol6
Mode	once
Cond	time	3300
Action	message	1	The last of the hill guard is marching.
Action	spawn	3	66	56	1	Knight:4	Knight:3	Elf:3	Monk:3	Adventurer:3	Dwarf2:3
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	rivalFalls
Mode	once
Cond	time	5
Cond	creatures	2	<=	0
Action	message	1	The rival keeper is dead and his heart is cold. The lamps of Lanternhill burn for you now.
Action	win	1
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	rivalHeartDown
Mode	once
Cond	goal	1	KillAllEnemies
Action	message	1	The rival keeper is dead and his heart is cold. The lamps of Lanternhill burn for you now.
Action	win	1
[/Trigger]
[/Triggers]
